{"id":"8a55d7649aa07b0b","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-box-distributes.md","title":"Box Distributes Over Implication","display":"prop-box-distributes — Box Distributes Over Implication","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-box-distributes","aliases":["89-prop-box-distributes"],"display":"prop-box-distributes — Box Distributes Over Implication","depends_on":["[[89-df-k-axiom]]","[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-box-distributes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-box-distributes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-box-distributes — Box Distributes Over Implication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}box\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathcal{A}_{K}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathcal A_K\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}box\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathcal{A}_{K}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathcal A_K\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{K}\\)</span> : K逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a>)</li>\n<li>该命题量化整个 K 公理模式，而非仅列出两个命题变元的一个实例</li>\n<li>正态模态逻辑的核心公理</li>\n<li>成员关系与集合包含关系分成两个合取，避免把\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\subseteq B\">\\(x\\in A\\subseteq B\\)</span>” 当作一个未定义的链式关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-k-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Box$ : 模态算子 (see [[89-df-box-modality]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{K}$ : K逻辑 (see [[89-df-modal-logic-k]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}box\\text{-}distributes}\\vdash\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B)\n\\bigr)\\in\\mathcal{A}_{K}\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathcal A_K\\subseteq\\mathrm{K}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A\\subseteq B","display":false}],"bytes":1078,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["97dd3729fefd2e30","550226a6aaff441c","d246470e97fec132"]}